``````
``````Stage 4 - Exfiltration (host-based, auditd) - MITRE ATT&CK T1041```
`````Alert only when BOTH audit keys (file read + curl execution) hit for the same user within 1 minute```
index=main sourcetype=linux_audit type=SYSCALL (key="curl_exec" OR key="sensitive_file_access")
| rex field=_raw "AUID=\"(?<user>\S+)\""
| bin _time span=1m
| stats dc(key) as distinct_events values(key) as events by user, _time
| where distinct_events=2
| eval attack_stage="4_exfiltration", mitre_technique="T1041", severity="critical"
| table _time user events attack_stage mitre_technique severity
`````
